    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nRAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to introduce to the market this 3 bedroom, extended terrace property located on Ashwood Way, Clondalkin, Dublin 22. This highly sought after and mature development is located just off The Nangor Road and is within a stone's throw of a host of local amenities including shops, schools, bars and The Mill Shopping Centre. You are within walking distance of Clondalkin Village and the M50 Motorway and Liffey Valley Shopping Centre can both be found within a couple of minutes' drive.  Bright, open and spacious living accommodation of c. 90 Sqm comprises of; Entrance hall, living room, dining room and extended kitchen/breakfast room to the ground floor. Upstairs you will find three bedrooms and a family bathroom. Externally this property benefits from a fully enclosed SOUTH facing garden with patio and lawn area whilst the front offers a driveway for off road parking. No. 5 comes to the market in need of modernisation throughout but provides an incredible opportunity for its next occupants to purchase a well located, extended property and put their own stamp on it. Further benefits here include gas central heating, double glazed windows and is offered to the market with no onward chain. Based on location and size and recent success in this development, we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your interest and book a viewing.\n\nFeatures\n\nBER C\nc. 90 sqm\nExtended to rear\nMature and sought after location\nDriveway to front\nNo onward chain\nFantastic opportunity\nClose to amenities\nUPVC double glazed windows\nGas central heating\nGreat public transport access\nCall today to arrange a viewing!\n\nDirections\nD22 Y795"
      },
      {
